Create one small, transparent UI icon for the Urkaaaz Loadout ammunition
cards. The icon represents ammunition with unlimited stock.

## Visual direction

- Use a clearly readable infinity symbol as the sole visual motif.
- Match the existing Loadout title strip and the warm gold/ivory treatment of
  `assets_src/loadout/ui/loadout_info_icon.png` and
  `assets_src/loadout/ui/loadout_selected_badge.png`.
- Keep the symbol clean and compact, with enough stroke weight to remain
  legible when rendered at 16–20 dp.
- Use a subtle warm highlight if needed, but do not add a circular badge,
  border, backing plate, glow that obscures the silhouette, or ornamental
  details.
- Preserve transparency around the symbol. Do not include words, numbers,
  ammunition art, a card, screenshot, watermark, or additional UI.

## Output

- Output exactly one PNG: `loadout_unlimited_icon.png`.
- Canvas: 128 x 128 pixels, RGBA, transparent background.
- Center the infinity symbol and keep all visible pixels inside the canvas
  with a small transparent margin.
- Save the file for review under `assets_src/loadout/ui/`.
- Do not copy it into Android resources until the user approves the preview.

## Review checklist

- Verify the file is a 128 x 128 RGBA PNG with transparent background.
- Check that the infinity symbol is recognizable at 16 dp on both a dark and
  a bright background.
- Ensure the icon remains visually consistent with the supplied Loadout UI
  assets and contains no unintended marks or text.
